sequenceDiagram
    participant V as Viewer
    participant Y as YouTube
    participant O as Observation Bus
    participant S as Safety Firewall
    participant W as World State
    participant A as RIAI Kernel
    participant R as Action Router
    participant P as Policy Engine
    participant T as Tool Adapter
    participant X as Verifier
    participant N as Noa Supervisor

    V->>Y: Chat message
    Y->>O: chat.message
    O->>S: normalize + classify
    S->>W: safe observation + provenance
    W->>A: context update
    A->>R: action.proposed
    R->>P: risk + policy check
    P-->>R: allow / constrain / human / deny

    opt high-risk review
        R->>N: review proposal
        N-->>R: approve / veto / escalate
    end

    alt approved
        R->>T: execute
        T-->>X: result + read-back evidence
        X->>W: post-state
        X-->>R: verified / failed
    else denied
        R->>W: record denial
    end
